      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Likewise on ultrawide, 32:9. The mic icon is so far on the side!\n\nFor those who use the Toggle mic setting, they might forget to mute themselves in some cases where it would be appropriate to do so, because they might miss the current status of the mic icon.\n\nNot sure if this would belong in this canny, but including the mic icon in the hide HUD feature feels inconvenient, where some would still prefer to see it but not all the extra icons and inputs.",
